title: "When No Enforceable Locus Exists: reproduction artifact"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, model-independent reproduction package for the ICAIF '26 paper
  "When No Enforceable Locus Exists: Availability and Representability in a
  Financial AI Agent Stack". Reproduces every confirmatory claim with zero model
  calls against a pinned open-source financial agent stack.
